{"headword":"מִיכַל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.pr.f. (</strong>according to Ol<sup>§ 277 f.</sup>; contr. from <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָאֵל</span><strong>)</strong>:—younger daughter of Saul, wife of David (𝔊 Μελχολ), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:49\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.49\">1 S 14:49</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.20\">18:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:28\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.11\">19:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:17\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:44\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.44\">25:44</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.13\">2 S 3:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.16\">6:16</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.29\">1 Ch 15:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.20\">2 S 6:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.23\">23</a>; also <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.8\">21:8</a> (𝔊 Μιχολ), but error for <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרַב</span> (𝔊L Μεροβ)."}]},"rid":"BDB05348","strong_numbers":["4324"],"next_hw":"מַ֫וִם","prev_hw":"מִיכָל","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4783"],"TWOT":[],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 190